      "reason": "The manuscript does not state whether all results compatible with each outcome domain (e.g., all measures, time points, analyses) were sought; it only points to extracted parameters in supplementary files without an explicit statement that all compatible results were sought."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_10a_e4",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": "text_13",
      "quote": "A full list of the parameters extracted is included in S1 Table, and the data extraction file is available at https://zenodo.org/record/4924035#.YOlzWS223RZ.",
      "reason": "Because the manuscript does not state whether all compatible results were sought (e3 missing), it also does not describe any process used to select among multiple compatible results from studies; no selection rules or hierarchy are provided in the supplied evidence."
